42
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:51,340
It is my privilege to serve you.

43
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:55,780
My 3,000 mages, my heart,
and my body belong to you.

44
00:05:59,740 --> 00:06:02,820
Vixor Ulshasta, head of the Dark Knights.

45
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:07,040
Before I pledge my
sword, I have a question.

46
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:12,660
Your Majesty, now that you've returned
