belong to the people of Darkness.

54
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:46,320
I have but one request of you.

55
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:50,680
To bring me the Priestess of Light
who resides in the Human Empire.

56
00:06:51,260 --> 00:06:56,120
You have permission to terrorize and
murder any other human, but she is mine.

57
00:06:57,440 --> 00:07:00,300
Go forth, my warriors of Darkness.

58
00:07:01,220 --> 00:07:02,520
Claim your destiny.

59
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:07,830
Kill!

60
00:07:07,913 --> 00:07:08,859
Drink their blood!

61
00:07:08,980 --> 00:07:11,540
Smash in their skulls
and rip up to pieces!

62
00:07:14,340 --> 00:07:15,170
Rawr!

63
00:07:15,253 --> 00:07:16,380
Hail to the Emperor!

64
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:18,750
War!

65
00:07:18,833 --> 00:07:19,920
Death to the White Eudes!

66
