73
00:08:10,860 --> 00:08:12,720
I just want to kill some fools.

74
00:08:13,100 --> 00:08:17,806
I've never seen VR be so real, so I figure
I might as well take advantage of it.

75
00:08:18,020 --> 00:08:20,920
I mean, I can friggin' taste this wine!

76
00:08:21,260 --> 00:08:24,120
Just remember, there's
no pain absorber here.

77
00:08:24,420 --> 00:08:27,437
If you get cut, it'll bleed and hurt. Bad.

78
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:28,540
I know.

79
00:08:28,820 --> 00:08:30,526
That's what makes this great.

80
00:08:44,340 --> 00:08:46,340
That you, Captain? Yeah.

81
00:08:47,260 --> 00:08:48,090
Good timing.

82
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:50,500
We got back to main control just now.

83
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:53,157
Wanted to make sure your
dive didn't have issues.

84
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,420
Thank you.

85
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:57,200
So far, our first day here went well.

86
00:08:57,500 --> 00:09:01,382
The phenomenon of accelerated time
takes a bit of getting used to.

87
00:09:01,500 --> 00:09:05,117
Other than that, everything's going
as planned, so I'm not complaining.

88
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:08,997
