her light cube to the main control room.

94
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:26,277
Click on that, and Alice's
light cube's as good as ours.

95
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,597
Oh, and while you're there,

96
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:31,297
