dumbass Vassago should keep in mind.

97
00:09:31,380 --> 00:09:32,210
What?!

98
00:09:32,293 --> 00:09:34,585
Since we don't have access
to admin privileges,

99
00:09:34,740 --> 00:09:37,540
we don't have the luxury of resetting. So,

100
00:09:37,820 --> 00:09:39,737
