137
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:25,360
I just saw Alicia's soul.

138
00:13:25,800 --> 00:13:30,300
And for a second there, I could
see what her soul was seeing, too.

139
00:13:38,560 --> 00:13:40,080
A human soul.

140
00:13:40,620 --> 00:13:42,973
I want to see more of what it showed me.

141
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:44,900
I can't wait to see it again.

142
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:05,140
I love you so much, my lord.

143
00:14:05,980 --> 00:14:08,100
That was incredible.

144
00:14:08,560 --> 00:14:10,800
What a glorious experience.

145
00:14:12,140 --> 00:14:14,717
Even though our flux
lights are in separate

146
