have suffered severe losses.

166
00:15:55,860 --> 00:15:59,777
If that's true, it will lead to an
imbalance of power among the tribes.

167
00:15:59,860 --> 00:16:01,517
The Council of Ten will be powerless,

168
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:04,835
