tribes will be rescinded.

169
00:16:04,920 --> 00:16:08,820
If that happens, it will become
another age of blood and iron.

170
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:10,800
That cannot come to pass.

171
00:16:11,260 --> 00:16:14,700
Our only hope is to make
peace with the human empire.

172
00:16:16,140 --> 00:16:18,280
I must speak with Bercoli.

173
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:23,420
I am certain he would agree
to our request for peace.

174
00:16:24,380 --> 00:16:27,498
But first, I must kill the
one who stands in the way.

175
00:16:27,860 --> 00:16:29,060
Emperor Vector.

176
00:16:30,380 --> 00:16:34,640
By the way, last night I discovered
an intruder in my chamber.

177
00:16:35,220 --> 00:16:37,600
They had a dagger hidden in their hair.

178
00:16:39,500 --> 00:16:43,980
Fear not, I won't condemn whoever
sent the assassin after me.

179
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:50,517
If you wish to have more power, there is
nothing wrong using treachery to obtain it.

180
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:54,800
And if you desire the throne, feel
free to attack me however you wish.

181
00:16:55,060 --> 00:16:56,060
With that said,

182
00:16:56,340 --> 00:16:58,920
if you decide to embark on such a gamble,

183
00:16:59,160 --> 00:17:01,925
