of over 30,000 in less than an hour.

193
00:18:32,780 --> 00:18:38,380
And compared to your stamina and total
life, you'll be dead in about three minutes.

194
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:55,840
My dear, they won't stop me.

195
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:26,200
Oh, my God.

196
00:20:06,260 --> 00:20:11,160
Nothing, a black void, does
this man not know life?

197
