He knows nothing of the radiance
of life, of love, of the soul.

198
00:20:18,600 --> 00:20:21,380
That's why he seeks other souls.

199
00:20:22,740 --> 00:20:26,180
No matter how powerful
my incarnate ability was,

200
00:20:26,580 --> 00:20:30,220
