a weapon of murderous intent.

201
00:20:30,860 --> 00:20:34,060
He has a soul, but it is dead.

202
00:20:35,640 --> 00:20:38,220
I'm so sorry, Lipia.

203
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:51,437
The troops who lost their
commanders shall appoint

204
00:20:51,520 --> 00:20:54,380
