highest rank to lead them.

205
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:58,140
We will begin the assault as
planned one hour from now.

206
00:21:07,320 --> 00:21:09,780
Long live Vecta, the Emperor!

207
00:21:18,600 --> 00:21:19,430
Hmph.

208
00:21:50,940 --> 00:21:57,457
If you're alone, you'll be
able to live with one person.

209
00:21:57,540 --> 00:22:01,720
I don't want anyone to love you.

210
00:22:05,600 --> 00:22:12,060
It's your scent, it's your story.

211
00:22:13,840 --> 00:22:18,177
I am the body of love.

212
00:22:18,260 --> 00:22:24,477
That's my dream!

213
00:22:24,560 --> 00:22:26,697
My dream!

214
00:22:26,780 --> 00:22:29,020
My dream!

215
00:22:39,560 --> 00:22:41,900
That's just?

216
00:22:53,580 --> 00:22:56,180
There it is, the Eastern Gate.

217
00:22:56,880 --> 00:22:58,540
Hold here, Amayori.

218
00:23:03,400 --> 00:23:07,660
